    "detailed_description": "<strong>Marie's Patisserie Collector's Edition</strong><br><br>Immerse yourself in a world full of delicious treats!<br>Marie is looking for the perfect job. After many failures, one day she finds herself standing in front of Charlotte's small patisserie, which urgently needs a temp. <br>Many challenges now await Marie!<br><br>Her first attempts at baking are anything but perfect, but Marie doesn't give up. <br>Her sweet creations soon attract many customers and the small failures she has experienced along the way have not been in vain. <br>Over time, the patisserie becomes a popular meeting place for those with a sweet tooth and gourmets alike.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>  - Entertaining Match 3 game with lots of challenges<br>  - Open a pastry shop with all the furnishings and delicious cakes and pies <br>  - Play many levels as well as mini and bonus games<br>  - Acquire effective and powerful power-ups <br>  - Choose three different game modes: normal, hard and relaxing<br>  - Win special achievements and trophies<br><br><br><strong>This is a collector's edition full of extras not included in the standard version. The collector's edition also includes:</strong><br><br>  - 50 more bonus levels <br>  - The opening of a wonderful cafe garden for the patisserie<br>  - All mini-games can be played again<br>  - Downloadable background images and stickers",
